  },
  {
   "texto": "Then someone knocked on the glass door, soft, three times.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "A woman, smiling, holding an empty gas can.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She said her car ran out, and she needed help.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "But her car was the one at pump two, still running.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I didn't move. Rule two: never go outside.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She kept smiling, and she stopped blinking.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the lights over the pumps went out.",
   "pausa": 0.9
